    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101235" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῡρίγγ-ιον</span></b> , τό, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῦριγξ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>little reed</i> or <i>pipe</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.456a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				4.72
			</span></i>: also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῡριγγ-ίδιον</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Spir.</u>
				1.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>hole in a wheel</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>small fistula</i> or <i>ulcer</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				6.8.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῦριγξ</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>groove, channel</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Mech.
				14.10
			</span></i>.</div>
